WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
- I really don't know what that means.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.253
I don't know what any of these mean.

00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:03.720
OK.

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.550
Cuz I never said thirst trap.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.810
I wanna thirst trap, but
I didn't know what that is.
♪♪♪

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:09.743
[Glass breaking sound effect]

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.809
What's up, B/R? Phil Mickelson here.

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.811
I've played golf for a long time and kind of

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.670
proven that, uh, I'm OK on the golf course.

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.350
And now I'm working on developing
my social media skills.

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.240
So how am I doing?

00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:31.380
And how can I get better?

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.650
You're the quarterback of a football
team playing in the Super Bowl.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:39.210
A team from New York has just defeated
you, and a photo is taken of you sitting

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.150
on the field with your head facing down.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.500
People begin to recreate your photo and
post to Twitter with different captions.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.799
You have officially become a meme.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:51.342
Actually knew that one. Wow.

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:55.889
Phil, that's me, says
he wants to thirst-trap

00:00:55.889 --> 00:01:03.705
and posts a photo of his—my—calves on
Instagram with the caption, "Felt cute,

00:01:03.705 --> 00:01:04.724
might delete later.

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:06.885
Hashtag Friday feeling."

00:01:07.815 --> 00:01:09.465
What is a thirst trap?

00:01:09.765 --> 00:01:13.305
Well, first of all, there's
nothing cute about my calves.

00:01:13.305 --> 00:01:15.575
And second, why would I wanna delete it?

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:20.413
Who knows?
[Slow saxophone]

00:01:20.775 --> 00:01:24.395
What is a burner account and which
of the four Match participants is

00:01:24.395 --> 00:01:26.615
most likely to have a burner account?

00:01:26.915 --> 00:01:31.475
A burner account is an account where
you can go onto social media and

00:01:31.475 --> 00:01:33.365
people won't know that it's you.

00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:38.645
And I think we're all pretty likely to have
one of those because...we'd like to have a

00:01:38.645 --> 00:01:43.595
little bit of privacy on social media and
not have people know that it's us. But,

00:01:43.595 --> 00:01:47.310
uh, Kevin Durant would be the most likely.

00:01:48.899 --> 00:01:51.149
It was Durant that got
caught doing that, right?

00:01:51.149 --> 00:01:51.690
Is that right?
- [Offscreen:] Yeah.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:52.350
- OK, cool.

